    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d46-a1">

                <pb facs="0161" n="65" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg65"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Count d’Aspremont
                            Lynden to Mr. Jones.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ministry of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Brussels</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-07-07"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 7,
                        1874</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of the letter which you were pleased to address to me, under date of the 1st
                    instant, to give me notice of the resolution <pb facs="0162" n="66"
                        xml:id="pg66"/> which the Government of the United States has thought fit to
                    take to annul the treaty of commerce and navigation of July 17, 1858.</p>
                <p>You are of opinion, sir, that the term of twelve months which is to follow the
                    notification will begin from the day of the reception by my department of the
                    communication of July 1.</p>
                <p>The letter referred to reached me on the same day upon which it was sent.</p>
                <p>The government of the King concurs with you, sir, that the treaty above mentioned
                    will cease to have effect on July 1, 1875.</p>
                <p>I take, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>COUNT D’ASPREMONT LYNDEN.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell Jones</hi>, &amp;c., &amp;c.,
                        &amp;c., <hi rendition="#italic">Brussels.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
